    "执行时重新验证来源；不会删除阅读数据、小说或 iCloud 下载。清理量不等于立即释放的磁盘空间。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "执行时重新验证来源；不会删除阅读数据、小说或 iCloud 下载。清理量不等于立即释放的磁盘空间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "執行時重新驗證來源；不會刪除閱讀資料、小說或 iCloud 下載。清理量不等於立即釋放的磁碟空間。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sources are checked again before clearing. Reading data, novels, and iCloud downloads stay intact. Removed cache size may differ from immediately freed disk space."
          }
        }
      }
    },
